  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "对于图象上的两个点来说，横坐标较大的点比横坐标较",
        "小的点的位置更高."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们将不作证明而承认性质1和性质2."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "3. 如果 $x=0$，那么函数的值等于1；如果 $x>0$，那么 $a^x↵",
        ">1$；如果 $x<0$，那么 $0<a^x<1$（这一点可由性质1和2得出）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "函数 $y=a^x$ 的图象，当 $a>1$ 时经过坐标为 $(0,1)$ 的点；当",
        "$x>0$ 时，它位于直线 $y=1$ 的上方；当 $x<0$ 时，它位于这条直",
        "线的下方."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在我们来说明，当 $0<a<1$ 时，函数 $y=a^x$ 具有什么样",
        "的性质."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为此，我们首先证明函数 $y=(\\frac{1}{2})^x$ 的图象和函数 $y=2^x$",
        "的图象关于 $y$ 轴是对称的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为 $(\\frac{1}{2})^x=2^{-x}$，所以方程 $y=(\\frac{1}{2})^x$ 可以写成 $y=2^{-x}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "不难理解，如果点 $A(k,m)$ 属于函数 $y=2^x$ 的图象，那么关于",
        "$y$ 轴和它对称的点 $B(-k,m)$ 属于函数 $y=2^{-x}$ 的图象. 实际",
        "上，如果等式 $m=2^k$ 是真等式，那么等式 $m=2^{-(-k)}$ 也是真",
        "等式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这就是说，函数 $y=2^x$ 的图象上每一点都和函数 $y=2^{-x}$",
        "的图象上它的关于 $y$ 轴的对称点相对应."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "反过来也成立：函数 $y=2^{-x}$ 的图象上任何一点都是函数",
        "$y=2^x$ 的图象上关于 $y$ 轴的某一对称点."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是，函数 $y=2^{-x}$ 的图象和函数 $y=2^x$ 的图象关于 $y$ 轴",
        "是对称的（图75）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "总之，函数 $y=a^x$ 和 $y=(\\frac{1}{a})^x$（$a$ 是正数，$x\\in R$）的图象关"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "198"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
